	(text "Power\nTP4056: R201 2.4k = ~500 mA. CE to VBUS, TEMP to GND (no NTC).\nCharge LEDs: on board (D201 red, D202 green) or off board on J_CHG; R202/R203 serve both.\nD203/D204 (BAT54W) let GPIO4/GPIO2 see CHRG/STDBY low without VBUS reaching the pins.\n  Firmware: charging = CHRG low and STDBY high; full = STDBY low and CHRG high; else no USB.\nProtection in the negative lead: BAT_N = cell minus, GND = P- (system ground).\nLoad sharing: with USB, Q202 is off and the load runs from VBUS through D205;\n  without USB, Q202 connects the cell. VBAT_LS = load side before the switch.\nOn/off: fit SW201, or a panel switch on J_SW, or bridge JP201. The cell keeps charging when off.\nBattery sense on the cell (2x 470k, ~4.5 uA): VBAT_SW would read 4.6 V from USB while charging.\nJ_BAT: check the cell's polarity before plugging in."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
